{% comment %} Wild Beans Story & Team – Tailwind, animations, hover effects {% endcomment %}
<section
  id="wild-beans-story-team"
  class="uppercase max-w-7xl px-4 sm:py-72 py-16 space-y-16"
>
  <!-- Story -->
  <div
    class="space-y-6 opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700 ease-out"
    data-scroll-fade
  >
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight">
      OUR STORY
    </h2>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      Wild Beans was first created by Vincent Rousseau, driven by a simple observation on
      add production sets: long days, tight schedules, and rarely a truly good cup of coffee.
      With his deep experience in production logistics, Vincent set out to build a
      service that could finally match the high standards of the crews he worked with.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      The project reached a new level when Vincent met Tom Darval, a barista with more
      than 13 years of experience in leading specialty cafés and strong expertise in
      sourcing, roasting profiles, extraction techniques, and coffee culture. Tom’s
      arrival brought a technical precision and quality-driven approach that aligned
      perfectly with Vincent’s vision.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      With their complementary strengths — Vincent’s understanding of on-set realities
      and Tom’s expertise in specialty coffee — Wild Beans evolved into a premium coffee
      experience crafted specifically for shoots, sets, and production events. From bean
      selection to equipment setup, everything is designed so each espresso, cappuccino,
      or flat white offers a real moment of pleasure, without ever slowing down the pace
      of the crew.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Team -->
  <div
    class="space-y-10 opacity-0 translate-y-6 transition-all duration-700 ease-out"
    data-scroll-fade
  >
    <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight">
      The Wild Beans Team
    </h2>

    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
  <!-- Vincent -->
  <article
    class="group flex flex-col items-center text-center rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
    data-scroll-fade
    style="transition-delay: 100ms;"
  >
    <div class="mb-4">
      <img
        src="{{ section.settings.vincent_image | img_url: '400x400' }}"
        alt="Portrait of Vincent Rousseau"
        class="mx-auto h-32 w-32 sm:h-40 sm:w-40 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 group-hover:ring-neutral-200 transition-all duration-300"
      />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold">
      Vincent Rousseau
    </h3>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-3">
      Founder &amp; Production Lead
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      Vincent brings years of experience in commercial production. He leads operations — planning,
      logistics, and on-set coordination — to make sure specialty coffee fits seamlessly into every
      shoot and supports the rhythm of the crew instead of slowing it down.
    </p>
  </article>

  <!-- Tom -->
  <article
    class="group flex flex-col items-center text-center rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
    data-scroll-fade
    style="transition-delay: 200ms;"
  >
    <div class="mb-4">
      <img
        src="{{ section.settings.tom_image | img_url: '400x400' }}"
        alt="Portrait of Tom Darval"
        class="mx-auto h-32 w-32 sm:h-40 sm:w-40 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 group-hover:ring-neutral-200 transition-all duration-300"
      />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold">
      Tom Darval
    </h3>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-3">
      Head of Coffee &amp; Experience
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      With more than 13 years in specialty coffee, Tom defines the entire coffee direction at
      Wild Beans: from bean selection and recipe development to barista training and equipment
      standards, making sure every cup on set tastes like it came from a top specialty café.
    </p>
  </article>

  <!-- Pierre-Baptiste -->
  <article
    class="group flex flex-col items-center text-center rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200/60 bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-sm p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-2 transition-all duration-300 ease-out opacity-0 translate-y-6"
    data-scroll-fade
    style="transition-delay: 300ms;"
  >
    <div class="mb-4">
      <img
        src="{{ section.settings.pb_image | img_url: '400x400' }}"
        alt="Portrait of Pierre-Baptiste Rozic"
        class="mx-auto h-32 w-32 sm:h-40 sm:w-40 object-cover rounded-2xl shadow-md ring-2 ring-neutral-100 group-hover:ring-neutral-200 transition-all duration-300"
      />
    </div>
    <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-semibold">
      Pierre-Baptiste Rozic
    </h3>
    <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm uppercase tracking-wide text-neutral-500 mb-3">
      Barista &amp; Logistics Support
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
      As the newest member of the team, Pierre-Baptiste brings fresh energy to the bar. He supports
      bar service, logistics, and on-set setup, making sure the coffee station runs smoothly from
      first call to wrap.
    </p>
  </article>
</div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wild Beans – Story",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "vincent_image", "label": "Vincent's photo" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "tom_image", "label": "Tom's photo" },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "pb_image", "label": "Pierre-Baptiste's photo" }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Wild Beans – Story & Team (Tailwind Animated)"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
